  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Pacific Leaders Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Pacific Leaders Program supports effective Pacific leadership and contributes to deeper and enduring relationships between Pacific leaders and Australia, through investments in community projects, professional development, and high-level visits.  The program supports key current and emerging Pacific leaders to enhance their ability to drive locally led initiatives that improve resilience, stability, and deliver strong development outcomes for Pacific communities.</narrative>
  </description>
